## Why This Is Asked

This question tests STAR-based reasoning in real-world edge deployments with cross-region risk and incident response in performance-sensitive environments like Cloudflare/Plaid.

## Key Concepts

- STAR method (Situation, Task, Action, Result)
- Telemetry, tracing, and region-scoped impact
- Feature flags, circuit breakers, canary releases
- Rollback, postmortem, stakeholder communication

## Code Example

